    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: You don\u2019t need to have played the first chapter to enjoy this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At 15 years old, I released my first survival horror game on Steam, <i>The Designer's Curse</i>, a game inspired by influential old-school horror titles such as <i>Amnesia</i> and <i>Penumbra</i>. Now, after finally finishing uni, I'm excited to bring you Chapter Two, <i>Forgotten Horrors</i>\u2014an engaging survival horror experience. Explore <i>Shaw Well Manor</i> once more, uncovering its dark secrets and immersing yourself in it's tenebrous atmosphere.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring incredible original music by Mikko Tarmia, known for his work on Amnesia and SOMA, the game delivers a hauntingly beautiful experience. With advanced physics-based gameplay (inspired by the works of Frictional Games) and terrifying creatures roaming the manor, you'll navigate its eerie halls as Albert, uncovering a story shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With satisfying, immersive physics inspired by the works of Frictional Games, the game's world is just at your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/6cad83d50fa42b61554d76ff53056ef0.poster.avif?t=1744135220\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/6cad83d50fa42b61554d76ff53056ef0.webm?t=1744135220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/6cad83d50fa42b61554d76ff53056ef0.mp4?t=1744135220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game pretty much on my own, coding away in my university dorm\u2014though I had some help from a few talented friends. After all that work, I\u2019m so proud to say it\u2019s finally finished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/116aefc8d659305883b6ee3d22aad558.poster.avif?t=1744135220\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/116aefc8d659305883b6ee3d22aad558.webm?t=1744135220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/116aefc8d659305883b6ee3d22aad558.mp4?t=1744135220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you can physically jot down your own notes in the inventory to keep track of vital clues. A built-in notebook also logs solved puzzles, ensuring you never lose progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: You don\u2019t need to have played the first chapter to enjoy this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At 15 years old, I released my first survival horror game on Steam, <i>The Designer's Curse</i>, a game inspired by influential old-school horror titles such as <i>Amnesia</i> and <i>Penumbra</i>. Now, after finally finishing uni, I'm excited to bring you Chapter Two, <i>Forgotten Horrors</i>\u2014an engaging survival horror experience. Explore <i>Shaw Well Manor</i> once more, uncovering its dark secrets and immersing yourself in it's tenebrous atmosphere.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring incredible original music by Mikko Tarmia, known for his work on Amnesia and SOMA, the game delivers a hauntingly beautiful experience. With advanced physics-based gameplay (inspired by the works of Frictional Games) and terrifying creatures roaming the manor, you'll navigate its eerie halls as Albert, uncovering a story shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With satisfying, immersive physics inspired by the works of Frictional Games, the game's world is just at your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/6cad83d50fa42b61554d76ff53056ef0.poster.avif?t=1744135220\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/6cad83d50fa42b61554d76ff53056ef0.webm?t=1744135220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/6cad83d50fa42b61554d76ff53056ef0.mp4?t=1744135220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game pretty much on my own, coding away in my university dorm\u2014though I had some help from a few talented friends. After all that work, I\u2019m so proud to say it\u2019s finally finished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/116aefc8d659305883b6ee3d22aad558.poster.avif?t=1744135220\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/116aefc8d659305883b6ee3d22aad558.webm?t=1744135220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606160/extras/116aefc8d659305883b6ee3d22aad558.mp4?t=1744135220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you can physically jot down your own notes in the inventory to keep track of vital clues. A built-in notebook also logs solved puzzles, ensuring you never lose progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "An unmissable survival horror experience with satisfying physics, haunting ambience, and terrifying encounters. Can you escape the horrors of Shaw Well Manor?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA very well-made game that will scare you out of your wits and give horror genre fans an awesome quality experience.\u201d<br><br><br>\u201cThe [first] game was built by a 15-year-old, which is impressive in itself, but one who also managed to bring on board composer Mikko Tarmia\u2014the mastermind behind Amnesia and Soma\u2019s soundtracks. That explains why the music is so terrifying\u201d<br><br><br>\u201cIncredibly proficient in what it sets out to be\u2014a simple yet satisfying first-person horror experience.\u201d<br><br>",
